                ISTIO<b>◆</b>FLUXCD<b>◆</b>GITHUB ACTIONS<b>◆</b>QUICKWIT
                <b>◆</b>
                VECTOR<b>◆</b>TRIVY<b>◆</b>SONARQUBE<b>◆</b>GITLEAKS<b>◆</b>
